OL,3,ATrump says Musk has restored access to
OL,4,AUkraine's Starlink network
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk has restored Ukraine's
OL,7,FStarlink internet access, US President
OL,8,FDonald Trump has said after
OL,9,Frestrictions hampered Kyiv's armed
OL,10,Fforces.
OL,12,FTrump made the comments after Ukrainian
OL,13,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said
OL,14,Fconnectivity to the military-grade
OL,15,FStarshield network, which is provided
OL,16,Fby Musk's satellite-based Starlink
OL,17,Fsystem, had yet to be fully restored.
OL,19,FMusk previously denied he was behind
OL,20,Fthe slowdown, which affects Ukraine's
OL,21,Fability to use drones to attack Russia
OL,22,Fand protect itself from attacks.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
